                    994.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Those passages differ in two ways. First, information that is only implicit in 3a is stated explicitly in 3b. More important, almost all the technical terms in 3a are toward the beginnings of sentences and clauses, increasing the passage's difficulty:",
